Z||000000||BUCK WILLIAMS||01-26-2001||08:02 PM||||I HAVE AN 86 SE THAT HAS HAD A GT CLIP PUT ON IT. WILL SOMEONE TELL ME ABOUT THE TOP PART OF THE TRUNK WHERE IT NEEDS TO BE SQUARE TO FIT THE GT CLIP. I HAVE BEEN TOLD THAT I NEED TO TAKE THE TOP EDGE OFF OF A GT TRUNK AND PUT IT ON MY SE SO I CAN INSTALL THE RIGHT GASKET TO SEAL THE TRUNK. IF THIS IS CORRECT TELL ME IF THAT TOP IS RIVETED ON OR HOW IS IT PUT ON SO I CAN TELL SALVAGE YARD WHAT I NEED. THANK YOU FOR YOUR HELP.<BR>                           JBUCKYWIII@AOL.COM<BR>                           BUCK WILLIAMS||||reg||5
